cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MAirCorridor, its tools or its data pipeline in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MAirCorridor: an Unreal Engine plugin and geodata toolchain for the M-Air corridor"
abstract: >-
  An Unreal Engine 5.7 plugin that builds very large Landscapes from any elevation data, places
  surveyed and generated vegetation onto them, and streams a photogrammetric scan at runtime,
  together with Python tools that download USGS 3DEP and Copernicus elevation and USDA NAIP aerial
  imagery for any area.
authors:
  - name: "Sean Rice - University of Michigan"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-16
repository-code: "https://github.com/sriceumich/MAirCorridor"
url: "https://github.com/sriceumich/MAirCorridor"
keywords:
  - Unreal Engine
  - digital twin
  - terrain
  - landscape
  - LiDAR
  - USGS 3DEP
  - NAIP
  - OpenStreetMap
  - photogrammetry
  - drone simulation
  - Mcity
